  <prompt>Migrate the Create Event wizard: remove applyFieldMappings, send only user-entered values, create through the BFF child-records adapter (it already uses withBffChildWrites), pass mappingSource when the filed-under parent differs from the mapping source.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE platform developer, React 18 / Fluent UI v9 code pages, Dataverse. Follow ADRs strictly.</role>
  <goal>eventService.createEvent has no applyFieldMappings; the payload holds only user-entered values; mapped fields appear on first load; owner = team.</goal>

  <context>
    <background>spec.md FR-16. eventService.ts calls applyFieldMappings at ~:368 and creates via withBffChildWrites(...).createRecord at ~:384; sprk_priority is set from the form at ~:208. Host: src/solutions/CreateEventWizard/src/main.tsx (sprk_createeventwizard).</background>
    <relevant-files>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateEventWizard/eventService.ts (applyFieldMappings ~:368 REMOVED; BFF create ~:384)</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateEventWizard/__tests__/eventService.fieldMapping.test.ts (rewrite: payload only user-entered values)</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateEventWizard/__tests__/eventService.cascade.test.ts (adjust only if it asserts the mapping call)</file>
      <file role="modify">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateEventWizard/CreateEventWizard.tsx (createRecord ~:272 wiring)</file>
      <file role="modify">src/solutions/CreateEventWizard/src/main.tsx (host; only if it constructs the data service)</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateMatterWizard/matterService.ts (reference migration (task 021))</file>
      <file role="canonical-reference">src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/RecordCreation/RecordTableRules.cs (created by task 012; Event row)</file>
    </relevant-files>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="022" status="complete">Project migrated and live-verified.</dependency>
    </dependencies>
  </context>

  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">Scope: this wizard only. One wizard per task, live-verified on dev before the next starts (spec FR-16). Do not edit another wizard's files or bffChildWriteAdapter.ts beyond what task 020 delivered; if the adapter needs a change, stop and escalate.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Scope: the create payload. The wizard sends ONLY values the user entered or picked (plus the filing/regarding keys the route needs). It must not call applyFieldMappings, read a mapping profile or pre-fill mapped fields; mapping, owner, search-index and I-1 stamp are applied by the server (FR-02, FR-06, FR-09, FR-10).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-012">Scope: the shared UI library. Edits stay in Spaarke.UI.Components (or the named package) and the wizard's code-page host; no copy of shared logic into the host.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-021">Scope: any UI touched by this task. Fluent v9 tokens only, no hard-coded colors, dark mode must render correctly.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Scope: deployment. Deploy through the code-page-deploy skill (build with the host's own npm script, never a hand-edited web resource). Rollback is redeploying the previous bundle; no runtime flag is added (spec rollout decision).</constraint>
    <constraint source="CLAUDE.md §9">Scope: auth. The wizard sends no owner, owning-team or impersonation value; the BFF decides ownership from the caller (FR-09). The route stays authenticated (existing authenticatedFetch).</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <topic>Create Event wizard; BFF child-records adapter</topic>
    <files>
      <file>docs/architecture/SPAARKE-FIELD-MAPPING-FRAMEWORK.md</file>
